{%- comment -%}
  The note that follows a price in the cart.

  **It is the cart's, and only the cart's.** It used to follow every price in
  the theme — the product card, the quick view, the lookbook, the search rows,
  the product page — under one shop-wide switch. It is now rendered by the bag
  drawer and the cart page and by nothing else, on request: a qualification
  repeated beside every figure in a grid of twenty-four is noise, and the place
  it actually matters is the one where the customer is about to pay.

  Two settings, in two groups, because they are two different decisions:

    - **Theme settings → Tax** holds the *words*. A shop states how it prices
      once — "inc. all taxes and fees", "inkl. MwSt.", "plus shipping" — and
      that is a fact about the shop rather than about the cart.
    - **Theme settings → Cart** holds *whether the cart says it*, because that
      is a question about the cart, and the cart is where it is said.

  The wording moved out of `locales/en.default.json` to get here. That is a
  reversal of the note this file used to carry — "changing 'inc. all taxes and
  fees' to 'inkl. MwSt.' is a localisation, not a per-shop style choice" — and
  it is worth being plain about why: the sentence is not one of a fixed set the
  theme knows how to translate. A shop that prices tax-exclusively needs to say
  something the theme never wrote, so it has to be a setting. A shop that also
  needs it in a second language translates the *setting*, which Shopify's own
  locale editor does.

  The `short` parameter is gone with the card. There was a shorter wording
  because a card's price line is one row beside the figure at 15px and the
  longer sentence wrapped it; nothing narrow renders this any more.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The leading space is real, not decoration. Callers trim around the render, so
  without it the markup is `$19.99<small>inc. all taxes</small>` — spaced by the
  margin on screen, but run together as one word when read aloud or copied.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.show_tax_note and settings.tax_note_text != blank -%}
  {{- ' ' -}}<small class="price-tax">{{ settings.tax_note_text }}</small>
{%- endif -%}
